OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of pupils to open GCSE
OL,4,Aresults
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 32,000 students in Northern
OL,7,FIreland receive their GCSE and some
OL,8,Fvocational qualification results on
OL,9,FThursday.
OL,11,FPupils in Northern Ireland cannot get
OL,12,Ftheir GCSE results online so will go to
OL,13,Fschool to get their grades.
OL,15,FResults are expected to be similar to
OL,16,Fthose in 2025, when around one third of
OL,17,FGCSE entries got the top A* and A
OL,18,Fgrades.
OL,20,FSome BTEC results will also be awarded
OL,21,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
